Package: ziiro
Version: @PROJECT_VERSION@-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: arm64
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libstdc++6, python3 (>= 3.9), ca-certificates
Suggests: alsa-utils
Maintainer: Marcin Szydłowski <2130376+marcinsz89@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Offline amiibo backup browser for Cardputer Zero
 Browse and search a catalog of amiibo figures and compatible games. Import
 local backups and optionally present them with the U219 NFC Cap.
